{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Celestial Empire: Prologue</i> is a <strong>free introduction</strong> to our upcoming <strong>Ancient China\u2013themed city builder</strong>! Lay the first bricks of your grand city, guide your citizens, and immerse yourself in the unique atmosphere of the game. <i>Celestial Empire: Prologue </i>won\u2019t include all the features available in the full version, but will let you have a taste of our climatic city-building experience, all whilst exploring the captivating world of Ancient China. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509970/extras/84f82f7c0ec78bafc0bbbb53d812b8b1.poster.avif?t=1757579875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509970/extras/84f82f7c0ec78bafc0bbbb53d812b8b1.webm?t=1757579875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1509970/extras/84f82f7c0ec78bafc0bbbb53d812b8b1.mp4?t=1757579875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build immersive cities of Ancient China</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique agriculture and irrigation system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technology progress and social advancement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex production chains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful choices shaping your city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beliefs, gods, and yaoguai attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade along the Silk Road</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four seasons and natural challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative Mode without limits</p><p class=\"bb_par